    "description": "<p>You are a Transcendent who approaches inner discipline through arcane principles. Meditation becomes a method of imposing order upon supernatural forces, allowing you to produce effects that resemble arcane magic through precise thought, movement and understanding.</p>\n<p>Your magical tradition is arcane, your magical ability score is Intelligence, and you gain Arcana as a class skill.</p>\n<p>Magical Tradition: arcane. Magical Ability Score: Intelligence. Arcana is used for Recall Knowledge and other checks concerning the path's arcane magic.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> Arcana becomes a class skill. Innate spells your Mystic class and disciplines grant, and the magical techniques that name your Monastic Path, are cast as arcane with Intelligence; a technique that uses your Technique Save DC uses 10 + Intelligence + your level.</p>",
